WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
powerful edge, a lot of the countries that we're talking about in oil and gas, such

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.440
as essentially closing the great North Sea oil.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.440
Oh, the North Sea.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.000
I know it so well.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.920
Aberdeen was the oil capital of Europe.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:18.139
And there's tremendous oil that hasn't been found in the North Sea.

00:00:18.139 --> 00:00:19.139
Tremendous oil.

00:00:19.139 --> 00:00:22.440
And I was with the Prime Minister, who I respect and like a lot, and I said, you're sitting

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:23.940
with the greatest asset.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:31.260
They essentially closed it by making it so highly taxed that no developer, no oil company

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.700
can go there.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.980
They have tremendous oil left.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:38.180
And more importantly, they have tremendous oil that hasn't even been found yet.

